--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
This library parses aisle and parking-spot calibration CSV files used by
DeepStream applications. It exposes AisleCSVParser and SpotCSVParser.
Refer to the DeepStream SDK documentation for more details.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- libglib2.0 Development package
- libgobject-2.0 Development package
- libjson-glib Development package

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ sudo make (sudo not required in case of docker containers)
  $ sudo make install (sudo not required in case of docker containers)

The library libnvds_csvparser.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/
